// S1's control arm -- "Two larders", with the brain's wiring frozen.
//
// `two_larders.ron` with one setting added: the ant's `mutation_rate` at
// 0.0. Everything else is byte-for-byte the same bed, so the two files are
// a paired comparison in the sense `CLAUDE.md` asks for -- same seeds, same
// rooms, same larders, one thing different.
//
// **What that setting freezes, and what it does not.** `mutation_rate` is
// the rate `brain::mutate` perturbs the *wiring* at each birth. The nine
// heritable traits -- the gut among them -- mutate under their own authored
// width, `CreatureDef::trait_variance` (0.15 on every slot in `ant.ron`),
// which this setting leaves alone. So this arm is not the clonal arm it was
// first written as: it asks whether the gut result in the live arm depends
// on the brain evolving alongside it. Measured 2026-09-06, eight seeds at
// 60,000 frames: it does not -- the plant room's gut sits below the flesh
// room's in **8 seeds of 8** here, paired difference median -0.12, against
// 7 of 8 and -0.17 with the wiring free. Fifteen of sixteen rooms across
// both arms, the same way.
//
// A genuinely clonal arm needs `trait_variance` to be settable, and it is
// not a parameters-page knob today (it is an array, and the page moves one
// `f32` at a time) -- so no scenario can yet switch trait mutation off.
// That is the gap this file's first version found, recorded here so the
// next session does not re-find it. Run it the way the live arm is run:
//   labbatch scenario=two_larders           arm=seeded runs=8
//   labbatch scenario=two_larders_fixedbrain arm=seeded runs=8
(
    name: "two_larders_fixedbrain",
    title: "TWO LARDERS FIXED BRAIN",
    question: "Two larders with the brain's wiring frozen -- does the gut still split between the rooms when only the traits can mutate? Read beside the live arm.",
    bed: (
        width: 512,
        height: 320,
        soil_depth: 96,
        ground_y: 160,
        compartments: 2,
        founders: 0,
        species: "herb",
        colonies: 0,
        colony_ants: 52,
        colony_species: "ant",
        predators: 0,
        lamp_spacing: 33,
        seed: 1,
        extra_walls: [],
    ),
    settings: [
        (subject: "ant", field: "mutation_rate", value: 0.0),
    ],
    placements: [
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 60),
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 100),
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 160),
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 200),
        Heap(material: "windfall", x: 180, cells: 30),
        Heap(material: "corpse", x: 330, cells: 60),
    ],
    timeline: [
        (at: 3000, every: 0, until: 0, what: Colony(species: "ant", x: 120, count: 52)),
        (at: 3000, every: 0, until: 0, what: Colony(species: "ant", x: 390, count: 52)),
        (at: 6000, every: 6000, until: 0, what: Heap(material: "windfall", x: 180, cells: 30)),
        (at: 6000, every: 6000, until: 0, what: Heap(material: "corpse", x: 330, cells: 60)),
    ],
    horizon: 60000,
)
